# RaceDay - Documentation

This folder contains all the planning documents for the RaceDay system.

## Files

### 1. erd.png
Entity Relationship Diagram showing:
- All 6 database entities
- Primary and foreign keys
- Cardinality relationships (one-to-many, many-to-many)
- Complete data model

### 2. endpoint-plan.md
API Endpoint Plan containing:
- HTTP Methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)
- Routes for all endpoints
- Descriptions and purposes
- Role requirements
- Request/response formats
- Covering: Authentication, User Profile, Events, Categories, Enrolments, Results

### 3. raceday-schema.sql
SQL Database Script with:
- CREATE TABLE statements for all entities
- Primary keys, foreign keys, and constraints
- Indexes for performance
- Sample data (2 organizers, 2 participants, 3 events, categories, enrolments, results)
- Runs without errors on SSMS

## Documentation Status
✅ ERD Completed
✅ API Endpoints Planned
✅ SQL Schema Created
✅ Sample Data Populated
✅ GitHub Actions Configured
